    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Restarting the myth, re-casting the legend</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five thousand five hundred years after the distant era of conferred gods, the Three Realms ushered in a time of change again. &quot;Black Myth: Eternal Tribulation&quot; takes you to a world that combines the essence of &quot;Wu Kong&quot; and &quot;Investiture of the Gods&quot;. Here, the three religions of Buddhism, Taoism and Demonism are constantly fighting, and the disputes between the mortal world, the fairy world, the demon world and the god world are intensifying. You will become a key role in this epic journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the descendant of the Three Pure Ones of Taoism, your mission is not only to assist Emperor Jiang in the crusade against Donghuang Taiyi, but also to uncover the secrets of your previous life, condense Pangu's flesh, and reshape the order of heaven and earth. In this mysterious land, every step may become a turning point in history, and every battle is a challenge to fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516270/extras/d687016efeb4880aa7498ffc6c557328.poster.avif?t=1752563169\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516270/extras/d687016efeb4880aa7498ffc6c557328.webm?t=1752563169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516270/extras/d687016efeb4880aa7498ffc6c557328.mp4?t=1752563169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique selling point</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exciting PVE and PVP:</strong> Compete with other players in fierce PK and feel the real passion of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Visual feast-like skill effects:</strong> Every skill release is a display of visual art, allowing you to immerse yourself in a colorful magic world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore unknown fairy equipment:</strong> Find those mysterious treasures hidden in ancient legends, arm yourself, and embark on the road of strength.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exciting battle for heaven:</strong> Participate in large-scale team battles, fight for control of heaven, and write your own heroic chapter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Smooth game experience:</strong> The operation feel is optimized to the extreme, ensuring that every click can bring the most direct feedback.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516270/extras/b536481a130d9aeda9d5ddc764ee44d9.poster.avif?t=1752563169\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516270/extras/b536481a130d9aeda9d5ddc764ee44d9.webm?t=1752563169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516270/extras/b536481a130d9aeda9d5ddc764ee44d9.mp4?t=1752563169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Background</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Wuchao's ambition grows, he is plotting to unite various forces in an attempt to subvert the existing three-world structure. At this moment, a destined soul descends to the world, carrying the power of Pangu's blood, shouldering the great mission of reopening the world. This is not only a contest of strength, but also a test of wisdom and courage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516270/extras/3592243d4e704247a522ae150c43f1bb.poster.avif?t=1752563169\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516270/extras/3592243d4e704247a522ae150c43f1bb.webm?t=1752563169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516270/extras/3592243d4e704247a522ae150c43f1bb.mp4?t=1752563169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Black Myth: Eternal Tribulation&quot; is not just a game, it is a journey of pursuit of dreams, adventures and glory. Here, you can meet like-minded friends and face unprecedented challenges together; you can also explore the secrets hidden under the heavy fog alone. Whether you are an explorer seeking excitement or a guardian longing for peace, let &quot;Wukong&quot; lead you into a mythological world that is both familiar and unfamiliar, and create a legendary story that belongs only to you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516270/extras/eefc7499b64d79272be1e454fbea06ce.poster.avif?t=1752563169\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516270/extras/eefc7499b64d79272be1e454fbea06ce.webm?t=1752563169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516270/extras/eefc7499b64d79272be1e454fbea06ce.mp4?t=1752563169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
