 PVE and PVP:</strong> Compete with other players in fierce PK and feel the real passion of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Visual feast-like skill effects:</strong> Every skill release is a display of visual art, allowing you to immerse yourself in a colorful magic world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore unknown fairy equipment:</strong> Find those mysterious treasures hidden in ancient legends, arm yourself, and embark on the road of strength.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exciting battle for heaven:</strong> Participate in large-scale team battles, fight for control of heaven, and write your own heroic chapter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Smooth game experience:</strong> The operation feel is optimized to the extreme, ensuring that every click can bring the most direct feedback.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516270/extras/b536481a130d9aeda9d5ddc764ee44d9.poster.avif?t=1752563169\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516270/extras/b536481a130d9aeda9d5ddc764ee44d9.webm?t=1752563169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516270/extras/b536481a130d9aeda9d5ddc764ee44d9.mp4?t=1752563169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Background</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Wuchao's ambition grows, he is plotting to unite various forces in an attempt to subvert the existing three-world structure. At this moment, a destined soul descends to the world, carrying the power of Pangu's blood, shouldering the great mission of reopening the world. This is not only a contest of strength, but also a test of wisdom and courage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516270/extras/3592243d4e704247a522ae150c43f1bb.poster.avif?t=1752563169\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516270/extras/3592243d4e704247a522ae150c43f1bb.webm?t=1752563169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516270/extras/3592243d4e704247a522ae150c43f1bb.mp4?t=1752563169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Black Myth: Eternal Tribulation&quot; is not just a game, it is a journey of pursuit of dreams, adventures and glory. Here, you can meet like-minded friends and face unprecedented challenges together; you can also explore the secrets hidden under the heavy fog alone. Whether you are an explorer seeking excitement or a guardian longing for peace, let &quot;Wukong&quot; lead you into a mythological world that is both familiar and unfamiliar, and create a legendary story that belongs only to you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516270/extras/eefc7499b64d79272be1e454fbea06ce.poster.avif?t=1752563169\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516270/extras/eefc7499b64d79272be1e454fbea06ce.webm?t=1752563169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516270/extras/eefc7499b64d79272be1e454fbea06ce.mp4?t=1752563169\" type=\"video/m